<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Round 4: Jae Seok and Seok Jin versus Ji Hyo and Jong Kook)</font>

990
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:53,640
<font size="64">Jae Seok and Seok Jin versus Ji Hyo and Jong Kook.</font>

991
00:22:53,640 --> 00:22:55,080
<font size="64">- Okay. - Sounds good.</font>

992
00:22:55,150 --> 00:22:58,950
<font size="64">Even if you go straight ahead, you can't tell where your right is.</font>

993
00:22:57,350 --> 00:23:01,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Discussing strategy before the final round)</font>

994
00:22:58,950 --> 00:23:00,880
<font size="64">Because you're blindfolded.</font>

995
00:23:01,850 --> 00:23:03,390
<font size="64">Jong Kook, when you're dancing,</font>

996
00:23:03,390 --> 00:23:06,120
<font size="64">if you go to the right, I'll go "hey."</font>

997
00:23:06,120 --> 00:23:08,390
<font size="64">- As a sign? - "Hey."</font>

998
00:23:08,390 --> 00:23:10,090
<font size="64">- "Hey?" - "Hey" for "right."</font>

999
00:23:10,090 --> 00:23:12,060
<font size="64">- If I say "ai," that's left. - Good luck.</font>

1000
00:23:12,060 --> 00:23:13,330
<font size="64">"Hey" means "right."</font>

1001
00:23:13,130 --> 00:23:17,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ssaebssaeb can't play games without tricks.)</font>

1002
00:23:13,330 --> 00:23:14,630
<font size="64">- "Ai" means "left." - Okay.</font>

1003
00:23:15,600 --> 00:23:16,600
<font size="64">They plotted.</font>

1004
00:23:17,170 --> 00:23:18,440
<font size="64">- Ready? - Jong Kook.</font>

1005
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,940
<font size="64">- Count for me. - Okay.</font>

1006
00:23:20,600 --> 00:23:24,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">("Twist King" by Turbo)</font>

1007
00:23:21,470 --> 00:23:22,640
<font size="64">Let's go!</font>

1008
00:23:24,110 --> 00:23:25,110
<font size="64">Hey.</font>

1009
00:23:26,040 --> 00:23:29,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kim Turbo is excited to dance to his song.)</font>

1010
00:23:26,210 --> 00:23:27,210
<font size="64">Hey.</font>

1011
00:23:27,210 --> 00:23:28,680
<font size="64">Hey!</font>

1012
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:29,680
<font size="64">What is this?</font>

1013
00:23:29,580 --> 00:23:30,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Grooving)</font>

1014
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:30,710
<font size="64">Twist!</font>

1015
00:23:30,850 --> 00:23:32,480
<font size="64">Wait.</font>

1016
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:33,620
<font size="64">- Stop the music. - Why?</font>

1017
00:23:33,820 --> 00:23:35,150
<font size="64">- Come on. - I was having fun.</font>

1018
00:23:35,490 --> 00:23:37,790
<font size="64">Why do you play Turbo songs whenever it's Jong Kook's turn?</font>

1019
00:23:37,790 --> 00:23:39,190
<font size="64">I'm a Turbo member.</font>

1020
00:23:39,190 --> 00:23:40,490
<font size="64">Play something else.</font>

1021
00:23:40,490 --> 00:23:43,190
<font size="64">Why can't they play Turbo when I am Turbo?</font>

1022
00:23:41,630 --> 00:23:43,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's been listening to his songs for 16 years,)</font>

1023
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:44,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(but he suddenly starts nitpicking.)</font>

1024
00:23:43,190 --> 00:23:44,800
<font size="64">I want to have some fun too.</font>

1025
00:23:44,760 --> 00:23:46,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A song request)</font>

1026
00:23:44,800 --> 00:23:45,960
<font size="64">CORTIS' "REDRED."</font>

1027
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:47,430
<font size="64">- CORTIS. - Let's start over.</font>

1028
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:50,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He requests a new song, thinking Turbo received special treatment.)</font>

1029
00:23:47,430 --> 00:23:48,970
<font size="64">- "REDRED." - "REDRED."</font>

1030
00:23:49,100 --> 00:23:50,500
<font size="64">I was having fun just then.</font>

1031
00:23:50,500 --> 00:23:51,940
<font size="64">- We should start over. - What's "Red?"</font>

1032
00:23:51,940 --> 00:23:54,240
<font size="64">- What's "Red?" - What is "Red?"</font>

1033
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:55,910
<font size="64">- Recent songs... - They don't know.</font>

1034
00:23:55,910 --> 00:23:57,610
<font size="64">- I don't know new songs either. - "What's 'Red?'"</font>

1035
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:59,180
<font size="64">I'll dance "Twist King" anyway.</font>

1036
00:23:59,180 --> 00:24:01,010
<font size="64">- Whose "Red?" - Ready?</font>

1037
00:24:02,550 --> 00:24:03,880
<font size="64">Play the song.</font>

1038
00:24:03,310 --> 00:24:05,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">("REDRED" by CORTIS)</font>

1039
00:24:04,380 --> 00:24:05,380
<font size="64">That's it.</font>

1040
00:24:05,380 --> 00:24:06,420
<font size="64">Let's go!</font>

1041
00:24:07,820 --> 00:24:10,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The two men get it started.)</font>

1042
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:09,290
<font size="64">- What's this? - This is it.</font>

1043
00:24:09,490 --> 00:24:11,020
<font size="64">- I'm going the right way. - Seok Jin!</font>

1044
00:24:11,020 --> 00:24:12,060
<font size="64">It's this way.</font>

1045
00:24:13,990 --> 00:24:16,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pretty good!)</font>

1046
00:24:16,530 --> 00:24:19,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok's choreo is pretty decent.)</font>

1047
00:24:20,130 --> 00:24:22,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The others are dancing like an old lady.)</font>

1048
00:24:22,930 --> 00:24:24,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Clashing)</font>

1049
00:24:22,970 --> 00:24:24,030
<font size="64">Who are you?</font>

1050
00:24:24,970 --> 00:24:26,140
<font size="64">I think this is the right way.</font>

1051
00:24:25,770 --> 00:24:30,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A mid-level manager dancing among his subordinates)</font>

1052
00:24:29,110 --> 00:24:30,410
<font size="64">Keep going.</font>

1053
00:24:30,940 --> 00:24:33,940
<font size="64">Forward. Jong Kook, go forward!</font>

1054
00:24:33,940 --> 00:24:35,950
<font size="64">Jong Kook, go forward!</font>

1055
00:24:35,950 --> 00:24:37,980
<font size="64">- Jong Kook, go forward! - Go forward!</font>

1056
00:24:37,180 --> 00:24:40,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Too focused on dancing to hear him)</font>

1057
00:24:37,980 --> 00:24:40,020
<font size="64">- Forward! - Jong Kook, go forward!</font>

1058
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:42,090
<font size="64">- Which way? - It's not that way.</font>

1059
00:24:40,780 --> 00:24:43,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He starts cheating too.)</font>

1060
00:24:42,090 --> 00:24:44,120
<font size="64">Back. Go back.</font>

1061
00:24:43,950 --> 00:24:47,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Both teams are now blatantly shouting out instructions.)</font>

1062
00:24:44,120 --> 00:24:46,320
<font size="64">- Stop right there. - Okay, a bit more.</font>

1063
00:24:46,320 --> 00:24:47,690
<font size="64">- A bit more. - Four,</font>

1064
00:24:47,090 --> 00:24:50,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Did anyone hear them correctly?)</font>

1065
00:24:47,690 --> 00:24:49,660
<font size="64">- A bit more. Go backward. - three, two,</font>

1066
00:24:49,660 --> 00:24:51,230
<font size="64">- Not there. - one, stop!</font>

1067
00:24:51,090 --> 00:24:52,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The music ends.)</font>

1068
00:24:51,230 --> 00:24:53,200
<font size="64">- Remove your blindfolds. - Okay!</font>

1069
00:24:53,200 --> 00:24:54,200
<font size="64">Ji Hyo was almost there.</font>

1070
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:55,800
<font size="64">- Okay! - Ji Hyo!</font>

1071
00:24:54,900 --> 00:24:57,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam steps on the number.)</font>

1072
00:24:55,970 --> 00:24:58,030
<font size="64">- Okay! - Seok Jin and Jae Seok won.</font>

1073
00:24:58,170 --> 00:25:00,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Jong Kook: 10, Team Jae Seok: 30)</font>

1074
00:24:59,470 --> 00:25:00,470
<font size="64">- Okay. - Well done.</font>

1075
00:25:00,470 --> 00:25:01,910
<font size="64">- Okay! - Well done.</font>

1076
00:25:00,640 --> 00:25:03,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Jae Seok wins the game.)</font>

1077
00:25:01,910 --> 00:25:03,410
<font size="64">- We won? - Okay!</font>

1078
00:25:04,340 --> 00:25:06,010
<font size="64">- What was that? - We were close.</font>

1079
00:25:06,010 --> 00:25:07,540
<font size="64">- Okay! - You didn't coach me.</font>

1080
00:25:07,540 --> 00:25:09,080
<font size="64">- I did. - He shouted like crazy.</font>

1081
00:25:09,080 --> 00:25:10,850
<font size="64">- He did? - "Forward."</font>

1082
00:25:09,750 --> 00:25:11,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I shouted like this.)</font>

1083
00:25:10,850 --> 00:25:12,080
<font size="64">"Jong Kook, go forward."</font>

1084
00:25:12,080 --> 00:25:14,150
<font size="64">- "Go forward." - We all chanted.</font>

1085
00:25:12,120 --> 00:25:15,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Manager Kim couldn't hear it and gets mad at him.)</font>

1086
00:25:14,320 --> 00:25:16,420
<font size="64">- We all joined in. - "Go, forward."</font>

1087
00:25:16,420 --> 00:25:19,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Disappointed)</font>

1088
00:25:19,260 --> 00:25:20,860
<font size="64">- The match is over. - Okay.</font>

1089
00:25:20,860 --> 00:25:22,260
<font size="64">- Ju Yeon... - Ju Yeon and Eun Ji.</font>

1090
00:25:22,260 --> 00:25:24,560
<font size="64">- Yes, Ju Yeon and Eun Ji. - "Catch Catch."</font>

1091
00:25:24,560 --> 00:25:27,430
<font size="64">I don't know "Catch Catch" well.</font>

1092
00:25:24,790 --> 00:25:27,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Right after Round 2, the girl group showdown)</font>

1093
00:25:27,700 --> 00:25:29,570
<font size="64">They said they'd play "Catch Catch."</font>

1094
00:25:29,570 --> 00:25:31,230
<font size="64">- I was learning the moves. - Were you?</font>

1095
00:25:31,230 --> 00:25:32,270
<font size="64">You suddenly...</font>

1096
00:25:31,530 --> 00:25:34,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ju Yeon said she learned the choreo to "Catch Catch.")</font>

1097
00:25:32,270 --> 00:25:34,470
<font size="64">You should've played "Catch Catch."</font>

1098
00:25:34,470 --> 00:25:36,610
<font size="64">- Eun Ji's great at this. - Honestly,</font>

1099
00:25:34,600 --> 00:25:38,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A bonus round of "Catch Catch" has been arranged!)</font>

1100
00:25:36,610 --> 00:25:37,610
<font size="64">I don't know it,</font>

1101
00:25:37,610 --> 00:25:38,640
<font size="64">- but I'll do my best. - You can do it!</font>

1102
00:25:38,170 --> 00:25:40,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Eun Ji)</font>

1103
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:40,110
<font size="64">Crush your senior with your new moves.</font>

1104
00:25:40,080 --> 00:25:41,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Annoyed)</font>

1105
00:25:40,110 --> 00:25:42,150
<font size="64">- What "new moves?" - I don't care.</font>

1106
00:25:42,110 --> 00:25:45,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A big match for pride, not points)</font>

1107
00:25:42,150 --> 00:25:44,210
<font size="64">- I'll go for it. I'm strong. - Ju Yeon doesn't know new songs.</font>

1108
00:25:44,210 --> 00:25:45,220
<font size="64">Watch out.</font>

1109
00:25:45,220 --> 00:25:48,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will she be able to show what she's got for real?)</font>

1110
00:25:45,680 --> 00:25:46,980
<font size="64">I'm scared.</font>

1111
00:25:47,750 --> 00:25:49,220
<font size="64">- Play the song. - What now?</font>

1112
00:25:48,420 --> 00:25:51,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">("Catch Catch" by Choi Ye Na)</font>

1113
00:25:53,520 --> 00:25:55,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Starting with the key dance move)</font>

1114
00:25:56,590 --> 00:25:59,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Moving the same arm and leg instead of alternating)</font>

1115
00:25:59,360 --> 00:26:01,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Flustered)</font>

1116
00:26:01,700 --> 00:26:02,700
<font size="64">This is insane.</font>

1117
00:26:01,870 --> 00:26:05,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She said she was confident.)</font>

1118
00:26:02,700 --> 00:26:05,500
<font size="64">- What... What's going on? - What is this?</font>

1119
00:26:05,540 --> 00:26:06,940
<font size="64">Eun Ji, you're doing great!</font>

1120
00:26:05,770 --> 00:26:08,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Eun Ji is dancing as if she's breaking bricks.)</font>

1121
00:26:08,140 --> 00:26:10,140
<font size="64">- What are you doing? - What is this?</font>

1122
00:26:10,570 --> 00:26:12,840
<font size="64">- Eun Ji, keep going. You're there! - Ju Yeon's...</font>

1123
00:26:10,870 --> 00:26:13,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She found the jib camera perfectly!)</font>

1124
00:26:13,080 --> 00:26:14,540
<font size="64">I think she's just...</font>

1125
00:26:13,840 --> 00:26:16,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The visual center's expertise)</font>

1126
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:16,410
<font size="64">Will you pause?</font>

1127
00:26:16,410 --> 00:26:18,880
<font size="64">- Wait. Ju Yeon. - We won. Nice!</font>

1128
00:26:16,550 --> 00:26:19,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The music stops.)</font>

1129
00:26:18,880 --> 00:26:19,950
<font size="64">Nice.</font>

1130
00:26:20,220 --> 00:26:22,790
<font size="64">You said you practiced "Catch Catch."</font>

1131
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:24,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing out loud)</font>

1132
00:26:24,190 --> 00:26:25,790
<font size="64">- What's wrong? - Eun Ji aced it.</font>

1133
00:26:25,790 --> 00:26:27,120
<font size="64">This is how it goes.</font>

1134
00:26:27,090 --> 00:26:29,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Catch)</font>

1135
00:26:27,120 --> 00:26:28,760
<font size="64">Dance without the blindfold.</font>

1136
00:26:28,760 --> 00:26:29,760
<font size="64">How did I do?</font>

1137
00:26:29,630 --> 00:26:31,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I think I did a good job.)</font>

1138
00:26:29,760 --> 00:26:30,930
<font size="64">It won't do. Dance without the blindfold.</font>

1139
00:26:31,160 --> 00:26:33,460
<font size="64">You danced "Gangnam Style."</font>

1140
00:26:34,230 --> 00:26:36,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Giddy-up)</font>

1141
00:26:34,730 --> 00:26:36,400
<font size="64">Isn't this it?</font>

1142
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:38,700
<font size="64">I thought you were dancing to "Gangnam Style."</font>

1143
00:26:36,870 --> 00:26:40,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A nostalgic performance by a 2nd-gen diva...)</font>

1144
00:26:38,700 --> 00:26:39,970
<font size="64">It was more like "Gangnam Style."</font>

1145
00:26:40,070 --> 00:26:41,740
<font size="64">- Gosh. - You danced a lot.</font>

1146
00:26:40,300 --> 00:26:42,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(brings the bonus match to an end.)</font>

1147
00:26:42,370 --> 00:26:46,140
<font size="64">Team Jae Seok won. You can exclude three members.</font>

1148
00:26:46,140 --> 00:26:48,010
<font size="64">Now we'll pay.</font>

1149
00:26:46,810 --> 00:26:50,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The 7 of them will pay.)</font>

1150
00:26:48,280 --> 00:26:51,880
<font size="64">The first vacation spot was Gwangmyeong Cave.</font>

1151
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:55,150
<font size="64">The total amount is 184 dollars.</font>

1152
00:26:55,250 --> 00:26:57,320
<font size="64">- The entrance fee. - The entrance fee is 100 dollars.</font>

1153
00:26:57,320 --> 00:26:59,320
<font size="64">- The coffee too? - Cave bread, 30 dollars.</font>

1154
00:26:59,320 --> 00:27:01,460
<font size="64">The coffee cost 54 dollars.</font>

1155
00:27:00,220 --> 00:27:02,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Total: 184 dollars)</font>

1156
00:27:01,560 --> 00:27:05,100
<font size="64">The remaining seven members must cover the bill.</font>

1157
00:27:02,690 --> 00:27:06,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(This amount will be split among 7 people.)</font>

1158
00:27:05,100 --> 00:27:08,160
<font size="64">- Okay. - You pay however much you want,</font>

1159
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:09,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(6 people will pay in order, choosing how much they want to pay.)</font>

1160
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:11,330
<font size="64">and the last person must pay the remaining balance.</font>

1161
00:27:11,330 --> 00:27:14,570
<font size="64">Let's split it fairly. It's not that much.</font>

1162
00:27:12,170 --> 00:27:15,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If they can find the lowest payer, they'll be exempt from paying.)</font>

1163
00:27:14,570 --> 00:27:16,870
<font size="64">We can split it evenly.</font>

1164
00:27:17,670 --> 00:27:20,140
<font size="64">I have no idea what that means.</font>

1165
00:27:22,150 --> 00:27:25,580
<font size="64">The last person will have to pay the most.</font>

1166
00:27:22,980 --> 00:27:25,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Calmly explaining again)</font>

1167
00:27:25,580 --> 00:27:27,280
<font size="64">- Yes. - That person...</font>

1168
00:27:27,280 --> 00:27:29,590
<font size="64">names whoever they think paid the least,</font>

1169
00:27:27,520 --> 00:27:31,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thinking)</font>

1170
00:27:29,590 --> 00:27:33,320
<font size="64">and if they're right, the person they named...</font>

1171
00:27:31,690 --> 00:27:34,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Anyone can tell she doesn't get it.)</font>

1172
00:27:33,320 --> 00:27:35,260
<font size="64">must cover the rest.</font>

1173
00:27:35,260 --> 00:27:36,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fake nod)</font>

1174
00:27:36,590 --> 00:27:37,660
<font size="64">Hang on.</font>

1175
00:27:38,290 --> 00:27:40,160
<font size="64">Give me paper and a pen.</font>

1176
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:41,160
<font size="64">Are you giving her a special tutorial?</font>

1177
00:27:40,700 --> 00:27:43,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mr. Yu has to teach her 1-on-1.)</font>

1178
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:43,130
<font size="64">I must give a special tutorial.</font>

1179
00:27:43,700 --> 00:27:45,340
<font size="64">I've never had a guest like her.</font>

1180
00:27:45,900 --> 00:27:48,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Embarrassed)</font>

1181
00:27:45,900 --> 00:27:47,540
<font size="64">You really don't get it yet?</font>

1182
00:27:47,640 --> 00:27:49,170
<font size="64">- Ju Yeon, you... - Look, Ju Yeon.</font>

1183
