<font size="64">- Don't do it. - What's this?</font>

3132
01:15:44,910 --> 01:15:47,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Rustling)</font>

3133
01:15:47,050 --> 01:15:48,080
<font size="64">Don't do it.</font>

3134
01:15:48,920 --> 01:15:51,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Serious)</font>

3135
01:15:49,120 --> 01:15:51,420
<font size="64">Don't do it.</font>

3136
01:15:52,750 --> 01:15:54,320
<font size="64">For goodness' sake. What is it?</font>

3137
01:15:52,990 --> 01:15:54,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Screaming)</font>

3138
01:15:54,320 --> 01:15:56,020
<font size="64">- What? - I told you not to do it!</font>

3139
01:15:54,990 --> 01:15:56,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Scolding)</font>

3140
01:15:57,060 --> 01:15:58,430
<font size="64">What is it? What?</font>

3141
01:15:58,430 --> 01:16:00,130
<font size="64">I told you not to do it!</font>

3142
01:15:58,490 --> 01:16:00,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pointing fingers at a ghost)</font>

3143
01:16:00,130 --> 01:16:01,400
<font size="64">- Hey. - Move out of the way!</font>

3144
01:16:01,830 --> 01:16:03,900
<font size="64">What? I told you not to touch us.</font>

3145
01:16:02,500 --> 01:16:05,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The ghost gets scolded for doing her job.)</font>

3146
01:16:04,160 --> 01:16:06,700
<font size="64">Which way do we need to go? We don't know.</font>

3147
01:16:05,030 --> 01:16:06,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sorry.)</font>

3148
01:16:06,830 --> 01:16:09,100
<font size="64">I'm sorry. Don't touch us.</font>

3149
01:16:09,300 --> 01:16:10,400
<font size="64">I'm so scared.</font>

3150
01:16:11,070 --> 01:16:14,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After scolding the ghost, they arrive at...)</font>

3151
01:16:11,070 --> 01:16:13,440
<font size="64">- Ji Eun, we're doing well. - How far...</font>

3152
01:16:13,440 --> 01:16:15,710
<font size="64">How far have we come? We want to get out now.</font>

3153
01:16:15,910 --> 01:16:19,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(the mannequin room with a hidden ghost.)</font>

3154
01:16:16,010 --> 01:16:17,080
<font size="64">Hold on.</font>

3155
01:16:17,580 --> 01:16:19,350
<font size="64">- What? - There is something.</font>

3156
01:16:19,480 --> 01:16:21,080
<font size="64">I think this is the real deal.</font>

3157
01:16:22,650 --> 01:16:24,690
<font size="64">I think there will be a ghost among them.</font>

3158
01:16:23,280 --> 01:16:25,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sharp)</font>

3159
01:16:25,050 --> 01:16:26,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After getting fooled a few times, Ji Eun got the hang of it.)</font>

3160
01:16:25,190 --> 01:16:26,390
<font size="64">Not all of them are mannequins.</font>

3161
01:16:26,850 --> 01:16:28,720
<font size="64">- You seem to be doing fine, so... - No.</font>

3162
01:16:28,720 --> 01:16:30,660
<font size="64">- Take the lead just this once. - No.</font>

3163
01:16:31,160 --> 01:16:32,230
<font size="64">All right.</font>

3164
01:16:32,460 --> 01:16:33,460
<font size="64">- Hey. - Hey.</font>

3165
01:16:33,460 --> 01:16:34,860
<font size="64">Haha, come with me.</font>

3166
01:16:35,860 --> 01:16:38,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Let me come with you guys!)</font>

3167
01:16:39,700 --> 01:16:41,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Screaming)</font>

3168
01:16:41,500 --> 01:16:43,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dropping to the floor)</font>

3169
01:16:45,710 --> 01:16:46,710
<font size="64">Are you okay?</font>

3170
01:16:46,940 --> 01:16:48,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Calm)</font>

3171
01:16:47,040 --> 01:16:48,710
<font size="64">I told you that there would be someone.</font>

3172
01:16:49,110 --> 01:16:50,840
<font size="64">Hurry up. We need to run away.</font>

3173
01:16:51,080 --> 01:16:53,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Deflating)</font>

3174
01:16:51,210 --> 01:16:52,910
<font size="64">Haha, are you okay?</font>

3175
01:16:54,010 --> 01:16:55,050
<font size="64">Meanie!</font>

3176
01:16:54,110 --> 01:16:56,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I'm not okay.)</font>

3177
01:16:56,180 --> 01:16:57,550
<font size="64">He is crying.</font>

3178
01:16:58,450 --> 01:16:59,550
<font size="64">It's that person.</font>

3179
01:16:58,650 --> 01:17:01,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Eun got immune to the ghosts after scolding them a few times.)</font>

3180
01:16:59,720 --> 01:17:01,760
<font size="64">- Are you okay now? - I think so. Hurry up.</font>

3181
01:17:01,760 --> 01:17:02,820
<font size="64">Go first.</font>

3182
01:17:02,920 --> 01:17:04,590
<font size="64">I'll follow you.</font>

3183
01:17:03,660 --> 01:17:06,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While Ji Eun becomes brave and takes the lead)</font>

3184
01:17:07,790 --> 01:17:10,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The leading team finds a switch)</font>

3185
01:17:07,790 --> 01:17:08,800
<font size="64">Hold on.</font>

3186
01:17:10,060 --> 01:17:11,370
<font size="64">- You startled me. - Push it up.</font>

3187
01:17:11,930 --> 01:17:12,970
<font size="64">Push it down.</font>

3188
01:17:15,370 --> 01:17:16,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Reaching)</font>

3189
01:17:19,270 --> 01:17:21,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Crying)</font>

3190
01:17:20,570 --> 01:17:21,980
<font size="64">This is driving me crazy.</font>

3191
01:17:21,980 --> 01:17:23,480
<font size="64">- You do it. - This is driving me crazy.</font>

3192
01:17:22,280 --> 01:17:24,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The nonstop horror is driving him mad.)</font>

3193
01:17:23,480 --> 01:17:24,610
<font size="64">You do it, Jae Seok.</font>

3194
01:17:25,180 --> 01:17:26,810
<font size="64">It touched my hand.</font>

3195
01:17:26,810 --> 01:17:28,220
<font size="64">- Seriously. - It touched my hand.</font>

3196
01:17:28,350 --> 01:17:30,420
<font size="64">- It's down. - Okay. Let's go.</font>

3197
01:17:30,220 --> 01:17:32,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(When they push down the switch,)</font>

3198
01:17:32,290 --> 01:17:35,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(baby's cry fills the room.)</font>

3199
01:17:33,520 --> 01:17:34,960
<font size="64">- What? - What's this?</font>

3200
01:17:34,990 --> 01:17:36,060
<font size="64">Right now...</font>

3201
01:17:36,190 --> 01:17:38,090
<font size="64">- Please. - This is driving me crazy.</font>

3202
01:17:38,090 --> 01:17:39,960
<font size="64">- Which way is it? - Let's hurry up.</font>

3203
01:17:38,860 --> 01:17:41,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The door opens slowly.)</font>

3204
01:17:40,290 --> 01:17:43,030
<font size="64">- Let's hurry up. - I want to get out now.</font>

3205
01:17:43,360 --> 01:17:45,230
<font size="64">Let's stop already.</font>

3206
01:17:45,230 --> 01:17:47,300
<font size="64">- Please. - Seriously. Please.</font>

3207
01:17:47,100 --> 01:17:50,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They put the cry behind them and reach someplace.)</font>

3208
01:17:47,300 --> 01:17:48,540
<font size="64">Hey.</font>

3209
01:17:48,540 --> 01:17:50,070
<font size="64">- Let's hurry up. - It'll open.</font>

3210
01:17:50,070 --> 01:17:54,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A morgue, where corpses are kept)</font>

3211
01:17:50,070 --> 01:17:51,540
<font size="64">- It's this way. - Which way?</font>

3212
01:17:51,570 --> 01:17:52,610
<font size="64">- This way. - This way.</font>

3213
01:17:52,610 --> 01:17:54,140
<font size="64">- Let's go. - We need to stand there.</font>

3214
01:17:54,140 --> 01:17:55,910
<font size="64">- It's a morgue. - Here.</font>

3215
01:17:56,080 --> 01:17:57,980
<font size="64">- Hurry up. It's the eye mark. - It's a morgue.</font>

3216
01:17:56,480 --> 01:17:59,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The mark)</font>

3217
01:17:58,210 --> 01:17:59,480
<font size="64">- The eye mark. - Let's hurry up.</font>

3218
01:18:04,320 --> 01:18:05,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Covered in sweat)</font>

3219
01:18:05,950 --> 01:18:08,060
<font size="64">I think someone will jump out.</font>

3220
01:18:07,650 --> 01:18:09,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Correct)</font>

3221
01:18:09,120 --> 01:18:10,390
<font size="64">- Please. - Stay away!</font>

3222
01:18:11,460 --> 01:18:14,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Crying again)</font>

3223
01:18:11,560 --> 01:18:14,130
<font size="64">Stay away!</font>

3224
01:18:14,230 --> 01:18:15,660
<font size="64">Stay away!</font>

3225
01:18:15,660 --> 01:18:17,230
<font size="64">- Please. - Seriously.</font>

3226
01:18:17,030 --> 01:18:20,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The morgue refrigerators suddenly open and close.)</font>

3227
01:18:17,230 --> 01:18:18,970
<font size="64">- Come on. - Don't come out.</font>

3228
01:18:19,300 --> 01:18:21,170
<font size="64">- We didn't do anything wrong. - Seriously.</font>

3229
01:18:21,170 --> 01:18:23,240
<font size="64">Stop it already.</font>

3230
01:18:22,940 --> 01:18:24,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Wind)</font>

3231
01:18:24,200 --> 01:18:26,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Screaming)</font>

3232
01:18:24,770 --> 01:18:26,240
<font size="64">What is it?</font>

3233
01:18:26,870 --> 01:18:28,410
<font size="64">Please.</font>

3234
01:18:27,210 --> 01:18:29,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(At that moment,)</font>

3235
01:18:29,040 --> 01:18:30,410
<font size="64">I think someone will come.</font>

3236
01:18:29,340 --> 01:18:31,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(someone exits a morgue refrigerator.)</font>

3237
01:18:30,410 --> 01:18:32,350
<font size="64">When will this end?</font>

3238
01:18:32,350 --> 01:18:33,950
<font size="64">- I mean... Someone is here. - Someone is here.</font>

3239
01:18:33,950 --> 01:18:35,580
<font size="64">- Someone is here. - Someone is here.</font>

3240
01:18:35,580 --> 01:18:37,280
<font size="64">- Someone is here. - Wait.</font>

3241
01:18:37,280 --> 01:18:39,920
<font size="64">- Someone is here. I saw him. - Someone is here.</font>

3242
01:18:37,650 --> 01:18:40,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A strange man with a grotesque face)</font>

3243
01:18:39,920 --> 01:18:41,390
<font size="64">- Mommy! - I saw him!</font>

3244
01:18:41,390 --> 01:18:42,460
<font size="64">It's the "Scream" mask.</font>

3245
01:18:42,460 --> 01:18:43,790
<font size="64">I'm sorry.</font>

3246
01:18:44,720 --> 01:18:45,960
<font size="64">It's the "Scream" mask.</font>

3247
01:18:47,290 --> 01:18:48,360
<font size="64">Ju Yeon, you...</font>

3248
01:18:47,930 --> 01:18:49,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sliding down)</font>

3249
01:18:49,130 --> 01:18:50,300
<font size="64">Mommy!</font>

3250
01:18:49,760 --> 01:18:52,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ju Yeon's legs give out.)</font>

3251
01:18:53,130 --> 01:18:54,170
<font size="64">Please.</font>

3252
01:18:53,830 --> 01:18:56,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The strange man suddenly begins to go wild.)</font>

3253
01:18:58,610 --> 01:19:01,170
<font size="64">- What's up with him? - Stop it.</font>

3254
01:19:01,170 --> 01:19:02,280
<font size="64">What's wrong with him?</font>

3255
01:19:01,310 --> 01:19:03,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Striding)</font>

3256
01:19:02,280 --> 01:19:03,280
<font size="64">Why are you doing this?</font>

3257
01:19:03,280 --> 01:19:05,050
<font size="64">- Why are you doing this? - Open the door!</font>

3258
01:19:05,650 --> 01:19:07,950
<font size="64">- Open the door! - It won't open.</font>

3259
01:19:09,020 --> 01:19:10,480
<font size="64">Mom.</font>

3260
01:19:09,880 --> 01:19:11,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hello...)</font>

3261
01:19:12,990 --> 01:19:16,120
<font size="64">How old will I be when I'm not scared anymore?</font>

3262
01:19:13,820 --> 01:19:16,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's 60 this year.)</font>

3263
01:19:16,460 --> 01:19:18,830
<font size="64">- Goodness. - Mom.</font>

3264
01:19:18,260 --> 01:19:21,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Crying)</font>

3265
01:19:18,830 --> 01:19:20,230
<font size="64">Don't.</font>

3266
01:19:20,230 --> 01:19:22,400
<font size="64">- Don't come. - Ju Yeon.</font>

3267
01:19:22,400 --> 01:19:24,330
<font size="64">- You said you weren't scared. - You said you were fine.</font>

3268
01:19:24,330 --> 01:19:26,600
<font size="64">- You're on the floor. - You said you weren't scared.</font>

3269
01:19:24,930 --> 01:19:28,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ju Yeon cries for her mom when she said she wasn't scared.)</font>

3270
01:19:26,700 --> 01:19:28,170
<font size="64">You...</font>

3271
01:19:28,170 --> 01:19:29,370
<font size="64">You said you'd lead the way.</font>

3272
01:19:29,370 --> 01:19:31,810
<font size="64">- He's still here. - Don't do it.</font>

3273
01:19:31,810 --> 01:19:33,110
<font size="64">- Excuse me? - Sir.</font>

3274
01:19:31,840 --> 01:19:35,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After causing a mess, the guy starts eating.)</font>

3275
01:19:33,110 --> 01:19:34,310
<font size="64">Please let us go.</font>

3276
01:19:34,310 --> 01:19:36,510
<font size="64">Where should we... Do we have to go out?</font>

3277
01:19:36,940 --> 01:19:39,650
<font size="64">- Let's get past him. - Let's get past him. Don't come.</font>

3278
01:19:37,080 --> 01:19:39,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Walking sneakily)</font>

3279
01:19:39,380 --> 01:19:42,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They walk past him quietly not to upset him.)</font>

3280
01:19:39,910 --> 01:19:41,720
<font size="64">Be careful.</font>

3281
01:19:43,880 --> 01:19:45,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Where do you think you're going?)</font>

3282
01:19:45,090 --> 01:19:47,490
<font size="64">- It's this way. - This way.</font>

3283
01:19:47,820 --> 01:19:50,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They see the exit sign on the hallway.)</font>

3284
01:19:47,920 --> 01:19:48,920
<font size="64">This way.</font>

3285
01:19:49,590 --> 01:19:51,420
<font size="64">- Run! - Run!</font>

3286
01:19:51,420 --> 01:19:52,430
<font size="64">Go!</font>

3287
01:19:53,230 --> 01:19:55,130
<font size="64">- He's coming! - Run!</font>

3288
01:19:53,890 --> 01:19:56,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Wait for me!)</font>

3289
01:19:56,760 --> 01:19:58,770
<font size="64">- He's coming! - Run!</font>

3290
01:19:59,330 --> 01:20:00,800
<font size="64">Run! Go up!</font>

3291
01:20:00,900 --> 01:20:02,670
<font size="64">- Go up! - Come!</font>

3292
01:20:01,870 --> 01:20:03,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Where do you think you're going?)</font>

3293
01:20:02,670 --> 01:20:03,740
<font size="64">Open the door!</font>

3294
01:20:03,800 --> 01:20:05,440
<font size="64">- Come up! - Come up!</font>

3295
01:20:05,440 --> 01:20:07,370
<font size="64">Come up! Hurry, Ju Yeon.</font>

3296
01:20:06,840 --> 01:20:08,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ju Yeon is about to pass out.)</font>

3297
01:20:07,370 --> 01:20:08,840
<font size="64">Ju Yeon! Come here, Ju Yeon!</font>

3298
01:20:08,840 --> 01:20:10,440
<font size="64">Come quickly!</font>

3299
01:20:10,440 --> 01:20:11,850
<font size="64">This way.</font>

3300
01:20:11,280 --> 01:20:14,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They must get out as soon as possible!)</font>

3301
01:20:11,850 --> 01:20:13,550
<font size="64">Go.</font>

3302
01:20:13,550 --> 01:20:15,320
<font size="64">Run.</font>

3303
01:20:15,320 --> 01:20:17,420
<font size="64">Go, go!</font>

3304
01:20:19,390 --> 01:20:20,490
<font size="64">Run!</font>

3305
01:20:20,620 --> 01:20:23,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They finally see some bright light!)</font>

3306
01:20:20,620 --> 01:20:23,020
<font size="64">Run!</font>

3307
01:20:24,620 --> 01:20:27,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sprinting)</font>

3308
01:20:24,620 --> 01:20:27,490
<font size="64">Run!</font>

3309
01:20:32,170 --> 01:20:33,970
<font size="64">- What is this? - Goodness.</font>

3310
01:20:33,330 --> 01:20:36,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Completely beat)</font>

3311
01:20:34,370 --> 01:20:36,170
<font size="64">It was too much!</font>

3312
01:20:36,370 --> 01:20:38,910
<font size="64">- Hey. - This is so annoying.</font>

3313
01:20:40,710 --> 01:20:42,010
<font size="64">- Ju Yeon. - Really.</font>

3314
01:20:42,010 --> 01:20:43,610
<font size="64">- You said you weren't scared. - You said you weren't scared.</font>

3315
01:20:44,480 --> 01:20:46,680
<font size="64">I miss my mom. I'm not easily scared.</font>

3316
01:20:47,010 --> 01:20:49,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ju Yeon became such a good daughter.)</font>

3317
01:20:47,180 --> 01:20:49,580
<font size="64">I miss my mom.</font>

3318
01:20:50,680 --> 01:20:52,190
<font size="64">- Goodness. - It was too much.</font>

3319
01:20:52,190 --> 01:20:54,490
<font size="64">It was too much. I think I scraped my skin.</font>

3320
01:20:54,490 --> 01:20:56,590
<font size="64">- It's scraped. - It's scraped.</font>

3321
01:20:55,820 --> 01:20:57,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam is injured.)</font>

3322
01:20:56,590 --> 01:20:57,890
<font size="64">- Are you all right? - Right here.</font>

3323
01:20:57,960 --> 01:20:59,690
<font size="64">- At the stairs. - At the stairs.</font>

3324
01:20:59,690 --> 01:21:02,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He was attacked by the mannequin ghost.)</font>

3325
01:21:01,760 --> 01:21:03,600
<font size="64">It was really scary.</font>

3326
01:21:04,900 --> 01:21:07,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Just as the three early team members catch their breath,)</font>

3327
01:21:05,030 --> 01:21:06,730
<font size="64">Ju Yeon.</font>

3328
01:21:07,930 --> 01:21:10,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Haha is in tears.)</font>

3329
01:21:09,300 --> 01:21:11,870
<font size="64">I told you there was something there.</font>

3330
01:21:14,870 --> 01:21:17,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Patting his back)</font>

3331
